<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/stage/op-2> a migdl:OperatingStage ; skos:prefLabel "End-to-end district batching optimization" ; migdl:stageNumber 2 ; skos:definition "Two separate optimizations, one per pipeline. Pipeline B full loads run 10-25 districts per trigger instead of one, collapsing per-district COPY cycles and write contention at the boundary. Pipeline A should parallelize to any number of districts (per-district tables, no shared writes), but a spike is uncovering why it cannot today. Both must land for this stage's KPIs to hold." ; dct:description "All change classes · Same as stage 1" ; migdl:eta "TBD (higher priority than stage 3)" ; migdl:figureUnreadable true ; migdl:unlockedBy <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/gate/batching> ; migdl:unlockedBy <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/gate/silverscale> ; migdl:hasBar <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/2-1> ; migdl:hasBar <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/2-2> .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/2-1> a migdl:JobBar ; skos:prefLabel "1 district Delta" ; migdl:forPipeline <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/pipeline/A> ; migdl:districtsPerTrigger "1 district" ; migdl:triggerKind "Delta" ; dct:description "Separate workstream from gold batching. In theory unbounded parallelism; in practice the B→S job fails at scale today (spike in progress, no hard ceiling yet). Blocks this stage's throughput until resolved." ; migdl:appliesInsert "yes" ; migdl:appliesUpdate "yes" ; migdl:appliesDelete "yes" ; dct:identifier "B → S" .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/2-2> a migdl:JobBar ; skos:prefLabel "10-25 districts Batched full load" ; migdl:forPipeline <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/pipeline/B> ; migdl:districtsPerTrigger "10-25 districts" ; migdl:triggerKind "Batched full load" ; dct:description "One COPY per staging table per batch; a failing district drops out and retries solo. Open: batch only the staging COPY (SQL still per district in a loop) or batch the Redshift SQL sweep too." ; migdl:appliesInsert "yes" ; migdl:appliesUpdate "yes" ; migdl:appliesDelete "yes" ; dct:identifier "GS → P" .
<https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/stage/op-3> a migdl:OperatingStage ; skos:prefLabel "Target state" ; migdl:stageNumber 3 ; skos:definition "Gold main can apply updates and deletes, so it never needs a rebuild. Derived and Platinum are cleaned and recomputed fully instead of patched by dirty keys (too many overlapping dependencies). If G3/G4 lands before batching, the interim is the same shape at 1 district per trigger." ; dct:description "All change classes, by delta through GM · GD / P correct by construction" ; migdl:eta "TBD (gold main deltas could be ready in 3 weeks, independent of stage 2)" ; migdl:figureUnreadable true ; migdl:unlockedBy <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/gate/g3g4> ; migdl:hasBar <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/3-1> ; migdl:hasBar <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/3-2> ; migdl:hasBar <https://migdl.midatahub.org/id/bar/3-3> .
